  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion, carrot, and celery and cook until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Add the tamarind paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the shrimp and cook until they are pink and fully cooked.",
    "Add the coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and cook for 10 minutes.",
    "Season the stew with salt and black pepper.",
    "Serve the stew hot over rice or with some crusty bread."
